 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 7.175,
   "text": "To test these theorems for ourselves, we built a live diagnostic experiment in PyTorch,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.825,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 7.383,
   "e": 9.274,
   "text": "and ran it on this laptop.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 1.89,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 10.056,
   "e": 18.095,
   "text": "We pitted two competing architectures against each other on the defining capability of modern foundational models:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.039,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 18.715,
   "e": 21.471,
   "text": "In-Context Associative Recall.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.756,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 22.979,
   "e": 28.577,
   "text": "In this benchmark, the network is presented with arbitrary key-value pairs",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.599,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 28.667,
   "e": 36.838,
   "text": "and must dynamically retrieve the correct value when queried with a corresponding key later in the sequence.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.171,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 38.111,
   "e": 42.971,
   "text": "The first contender is a Self-Organizing Dynamic Rewiring Network,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.86,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 43.177,
   "e": 51.309,
   "text": "equipped with continuous Hebbian updates, localized synaptic competition, and top-k structural edge pruning.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.132,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 51.648,
   "e": 59.762,
   "text": "The second contender is a small two-layer attention Transformer, trained with ordinary backpropagation.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.114,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 60.831,
   "e": 63.156,
   "text": "Both models saw identical data:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.325,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 63.271,
   "e": 73.131,
   "text": "sixty-four dimensional embeddings, sixteen key-value pairs per sequence, thirteen possible values, for one hundred epochs.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 9.861,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 73.834,
   "e": 76.053,
   "text": "The results were unequivocal.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.22,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 76.874,
   "e": 80.909,
   "text": "For the first forty epochs, nothing seemed to happen.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.035,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 81.129,
   "e": 84.689,
   "text": "Both networks hovered just above chance,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.56,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 84.786,
   "e": 90.55,
   "text": "which for thirteen possible values is seven point seven percent.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.764,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 91.827,
   "e": 95.644,
   "text": "The self-organizing network never left that floor.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.817,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 96.027,
   "e": 99.887,
   "text": "Its recall accuracy flatlined near twelve percent,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.859,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 100.196,
   "e": 106.704,
   "text": "completely unable to bind dynamic keys to their values in context.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.508,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 108.035,
   "e": 112.661,
   "text": "Its local updates kept compressing its representation anyway.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.626,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 113.153,
   "e": 117.901,
   "text": "Its effective rank drifted down from forty-nine toward thirty,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.748,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 118.027,
   "e": 120.046,
   "text": "without ever learning the task.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.019,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 120.901,
   "e": 123.651,
   "text": "And the gradient paths explain why.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 124.666,
   "e": 127.666,
   "text": "Structural mutations are discrete.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 128.068,
   "e": 132.57,
   "text": "A pruning mask is a step function, with no useful derivative.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.502,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 132.79,
   "e": 139.149,
   "text": "The optimization could not send credit across the links it was busy creating and destroying,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.359,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 139.287,
   "e": 143.096,
   "text": "locking the architecture into poor local minima.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.809,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 143.796,
   "e": 147.779,
   "text": "The Transformer, meanwhile, did something remarkable.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.983,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 148.342,
   "e": 153.031,
   "text": "Around epoch forty-five, its accuracy suddenly jumped,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.689,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 153.183,
   "e": 158.585,
   "text": "from under thirty percent to ninety-nine percent in just four epochs,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.402,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 158.824,
   "e": 161.396,
   "text": "and then settled at one hundred.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.573,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "s": 162.187,
   "e": 170.814,
   "text": "That sudden leap looks exactly like the phase change Olsson and colleagues tied to the formation of induction heads.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.627,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "s": 171.962,
   "e": 175.956,
   "text": "The theory survived contact with real silicon.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.994,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "s": 176.176,
   "e": 184.8,
   "text": "Without all-to-all bilinear attention, local rewiring algorithms cannot sustain dynamic in-context memory.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.624,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "s": 185.524,
   "e": 190.641,
   "text": "The Transformer's dense matrix multiplications win decisively.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.117,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  }
 ]
}